Topic has clear named tensions (source-tensions.json, comparisons.md) → strong-thesis / steelman-contrarian / synthesis-reconciler split.

## Draft A — Strongest thesis (attribution-revisionist)

Argue forcefully that cold-chain enablement was won mostly OFF the lab bench: sucrose cryoprotection and the Tris swap earned frozen deployment, but every large multiplier in the shipped timeline (−80/−60°C → −20°C depot → 120 h → 30 days → 10 weeks refrigerated) was a dated evidence event converting conservative labeling into warmer labels, and m1Ψ's direct storage credit is ≤10%. Name the Karikó⇒cold-chain conflation as the central public misreading, and split genuine physical-state gains from artifact correction before counting either as a "breakthrough."

## Draft B — Steelman contrarian (chemistry-first defense)

Defend the minority view seriously: mRNA really is kinetically fragile (single-strand-break all-or-nothing potency, >100-fold site hydrolysis variation, ~24 vol% water LNP core keeping cargo hydrolysis-exposed), so the ultra-cold start reflected real chemistry plus dry-ice shipper engineering prudence, not mere timidity. Formulation chemistry (sucrose cryoprotection preventing >50% freeze-thaw potency loss; Tris as aldehyde sink tripling refrigerated life; C12-200 holding expression at 25°C where SM-102 failed) moved actual thermodynamic margin no dossier could invent; linkage-level In-line-seq effects mean m1Ψ should not be zeroed out; and the LNP's storage role remains unquantified and possibly negative — the strongest case that bench chemistry was the binding constraint.

## Draft C — Synthesis reconciler (boundary conditions)

Both camps capture part of the truth; the report's job is the boundary conditions. Chemistry sets the ceiling of what is physically possible (water removal, cryoprotection, buffer pH, particle integrity); evidence dossiers decide how much of that margin any label may claim at a given date; neither substitutes for the other. Deliver the layered attribution with an explicit artifact-correction split (de-conservatization ≠ new stability), commit to defensible credit shares, state the confidence ceiling once (decisive manufacturer dossiers are confidential), and let the dual correction — freezing was necessary but ultra-cold was not; m1Ψ made vaccines work but did not keep them cold — carry the Opinionated Synthesis.
