 ## 6. Opinionated Synthesis: Which Breakthroughs Actually Unlocked the Cold Chain
 
 Line up BNT162b2's labels — tiers running ultracold depot, pharmaceutical freezer, refrigerator, clocked ambient handling — and force each movement to declare what changed physically. From the December 2020 authorization, −80/−60 °C depot and 120 hours refrigerated post-thaw [[dailymed-pfizer-biontech-covid-19-vaccine-bnt162b2-injection-suspension]], the window reached ten weeks: fourteen-fold. May 2021's six-fold jump involved zero product change; Tris added ~3.3×; ln(6)/ln(14) puts two-thirds of the expansion in the uncovering column. The regulator's file concurs: finished product authorized at −90/−60 °C on "limited stability data" from essentially one clinical batch, active substance approved at −20 ± 5 °C the same month, warmer-depot investigation formally directed six weeks later — and the shipping band wraps dry ice sublimating at −78.5 °C, inside the label [[comirnaty-chmp-assessment-report-ema7073832020-initial-ma-19-feb-2021-stability]].

